  description: Mercury is the closest planet to the Sun and the smallest planet in
    the Solar System. It has rocky surface covered with craters and experiences extreme
    temperature changes between day and night.
  interestingFact: A year on Mercury lasts only 88 Earth days, but one sunrise-to-sunrise
    day lasts about 176 Earth days.
